'''Ghost Baa Baa''' (ゴーストメェメェ ''Gōsuto Me~eme~e'', '''Ghost Mee Mee''') is one of the '''Ghost Gang''' members (ゴーストマスターズ, ''Gōsutomasutāzu'', '''Ghost Masters''') that are introduced in [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]]. It also appears in [[The Haunted 1LDK]], the final stage of [[Mouseyland]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]].

