==Enemy==
Ghost Baa Baa is the [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Baa Baa]]. It's two times more powerful in terms of health and damage, effectively becoming a Floating, single-target [[Hippoe]], but it is still hardly a threat.

==Strategy==
Since it is only twice as strong as the regular Baa Baa, almost anything can kill it with ease.

